# Short aliases for the Storylivingry Studio deck.
# 200 = rewrite, not redirect: every URL below serves the same file and none
# of them bounce, so links already shared keep working unchanged.
# There is only ONE copy of the file, at /storylivingrystudiodeck/index.html.
# Rules match top-down, first match wins. Add anything new BELOW these.
# Canonical and og:url inside the page both point at /intro.
/intro     /storylivingrystudiodeck/index.html   200
/intro/    /storylivingrystudiodeck/index.html   200
/deck      /storylivingrystudiodeck/index.html   200
/deck/     /storylivingrystudiodeck/index.html   200
